WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.590 line:95%,end
These companies are often born in the 2010s –

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:05.190 line:95%,end
they've been around for 10, 15 years.

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:09.150 line:95%,end
They often have some kind of technical debt.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:12.210 line:95%,end
They also, of course, serve the public sector.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:18.130 line:95%,end
Serving the public sector requires winning public tenders in many cases.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:25.150 line:95%,end
And scaling often requires both going outside of the core market,

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:31.210 line:95%,end
which might be one Nordic country, and going into adjacent workflows.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:35.890 line:95%,end
Both of these would often require capital and competence.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:41.990 line:95%,end
Often these companies lack both of these in order to scale properly.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:50.750 line:95%,end
They often have 15–20 employees, and they just are unable to take that next step.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.070 line:95%,end
That is where PubliX comes in.

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:57.410 line:95%,end
So we help them unlock the next growth engine in their journey.
